  <Title>k__BackingField: Route Optimisation Assessment
  <Description>k__BackingField: The knowledge assessment for this module covers zone
    sequencing, batched picking principles, congestion response, and route planning.
    12 questions. 80 percent to pass. The questions are drawn from the scenarios
    you completed, the rules for batching orders, when not to batch, how to respond
    to a blocked aisle, and how to read the path comparison data.
